\item[S2] A. Assem, M. Koloschin and M. Pitz, The Nash-Williams orientation theorem for graphs with countably many ends (2024), Introduction, Conjecture 1.2 and graph-connectivity definitions, pp.1--2. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/2310.03601}.
